  "headline": "Indonesian Police Dismiss General Eko Hadi Over Illegal Wiretapping",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesian General Dismissed After Illegal Wiretapping Case",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police have dismissed Irjen Eko Hadi Santoso for illegal wiretapping involving President Prabowo. The official has filed an appeal.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Indonesian National Police ethics commission dismissed Irjen Eko Hadi Santoso following findings of illegal wiretapping and conspiracy.",
    "The former official publicly expressed remorse and issued an apology during the ethics hearing while confirming his intent to file an appeal.",
    "Police leadership stated that the dismissal of the officer reflects a commitment to institutional discipline and the absence of impunity."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) held a Code of Ethics Commission (KKEP) hearing to address allegations against Irjen Eko Hadi Santoso. The proceedings concluded that the officer engaged in disreputable conduct by conspiring to perform unauthorized wiretapping, which reportedly targeted President Prabowo. The commission issued a decision for dishonorable discharge (PTDH) as a result of these findings. During the session, the officer presented testimony, including from a character witness, but was ultimately found to have violated professional standards. Following the ruling, the officer expressed remorse and apologized for his actions while officially submitting a request to appeal the dismissal. Police authorities emphasized that this disciplinary action aligns with their policy to maintain accountability within the force, ensuring that no members are exempt from professional standards regardless of their rank.",
